ping charlie\nMentha longifolia\nMentha suaveolens\nPennyroyal\nPeppermint\n Schizonepeta tenuifolia\nBursera graveolens", "chimica": "The enzyme (+)-pulegone reductase from peppermint catalyses a reduction reaction which gives a mixture of (–)-menthone and (+)-isomenthone:\n\nIt uses nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate (NADPH) as its cofactor.", "titolo": "Pulegone", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pulegone"}, "wikipedia_titoli": {"en": "Pulegone"}}